osani/","title":"Vaiṣṇava Vijñāpti"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":157,"first_line":"je ānilo prema-dhana karuṇā prachura","author":"Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"},"title":["Viraha-gīti"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["je ānilo prema-dhana karuṇā prachura","heno prabhu kothā gelā āchārya-ṭhākura"],"translation":["That personality who delivered the treasure of prema-bhakti, who was so intense with compassion — where is such a personality to be found as Śrī Āchārya Ṭhākur (Śrīnivās Āchārya)?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["kā̐hā mora svarūp rūpa kā̐hā sanātana","kā̐hā dāsa raghunātha patita-pāvana"],"translation":["Where are the saviours of the fallen souls? Where is my Svarūp Dāmodar, and where are Rūpa Goswāmī and Sanātan Goswāmī? Where is Raghunāth Dās to be found?"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["kā̐hā mora bhaṭṭa-juga kā̐hā kavirāja","eka-kāle kothā gelā gaurā naṭa-rāja"],"translation":["Where are my Raghunāth Bhaṭṭa and Gopāl Bhaṭṭa Goswāmīs? Where am I to find Śrī Krishnadās Kavirāj now? All at once they have gone to join Lord Gaurāṅga, the great dancer."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["pāṣāṇe kuṭibo māthā anale paśibo","gaurāṅga guṇera nidhi kothā gele pābo"],"translation":["To reach such a perfect personality as Lord Chaitanya, I can only break my head against the stone in the anguish of separation."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["se-saba saṅgīra saṅge je koilo vilāsa","se-saṅga nā pāyā kānde narottama dāsa"],"translation":["They have all gone off together in their own Pastimes. Narottam Dās Ṭhākur says: “Unable to obtain their association, I must simply weep.”"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/krsnachaitanya-das/49-ye-anilo-prema-dhana-1","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.R. Madhusudan Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/madhusudan-maharaj-viraha-giti","personSlug":"srila-b-r-madhusudan-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/goswami-maharaj-viraha-giti","personSlug":"srila-b-s-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/je-anilo-prema-dhana","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/je-anilo-prema-dhana-karuna-prachura/","description":"Viraha-gīti — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Viraha-gīti. by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-2022","slug":"je-anilo-prema-dhana-karuna-prachura"}}